WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
Interactive simulation in the public showcase.

00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:05.250
Deny stops the proposed action at the gateway.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.667
A sensitive action takes the human review path.

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:12.917
Explore the architecture and inspect its controls.

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:16.917
The decision lab replays the independent approval requirement.

00:00:16.917 --> 00:00:20.250
After approval, the stored ticket closed once at revision 1.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:25.500
Filter recorded observations by decision.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.083
Compare access for a different synthetic organization.

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:33.333
Switch languages and inspect the same organization boundary.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:37.417
Browse the Arabic evidence notes and the real product recording.

